; Default quadcopter (quad X) for GWMultirotorBody — a ~0.7 kg 5" FPV freestyle
; quad. Quadratic thrust curve (hover ≈ sqrt(1/TWR) ≈ 41% stick), quadratic
; airframe drag, rotor H-force, inflow thrust washout, and a realistic
; (centre-weighted) inertia so rotation is FPV-snappy. Tune to taste.
